### WorkCred REST API - Step 10 Auth & User Profiles
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api/v1
@appOrigin = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Request OTP Code (Worker - Ravi)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/otp/request
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "9000000001"
}

### 2. Verify OTP Code (Worker - Ravi)
# @name verifyRavi
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/otp/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "9000000001",
  "code": "123456"
}

### 3. Get Private User Profile (Ravi)
@raviToken = {{verifyRavi.response.body.data.accessToken}}
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{raviToken}}

### 4. Set Initial Role (Worker)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me/role
Authorization: Bearer {{raviToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "worker"
}

### 5. Update Profile & Generate Passport Slug (Worker - Ravi)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{raviToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ravi Shinde",
  "skills": ["masonry", "painting"],
  "rate": 800,
  "rateUnit": "day",
  "bio": "Experienced mason with over 10 years working across Pune and PCMC.",
  "area": "Kothrud",
  "city": "Pune",
  "location": {
    "lat": 18.5074,
    "lng": 73.8077
  },
  "photoUrl": "https://res.cloudinary.com/workcred/image/upload/v1/workers/ravi.jpg"
}

### 6. Refresh Session (Rotate Refresh Token)
# Note: In browser/REST client, cookie wc_rt is sent automatically after login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json
X-Requested-With: workcred
Origin: {{appOrigin}}

### 7. Logout (Revoke Session Family)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json
X-Requested-With: workcred
Origin: {{appOrigin}}

### 8. Request OTP Code (Customer - Meera)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/otp/request
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "9000000002"
}

### 9. Verify OTP Code (Customer - Meera)
# @name verifyMeera
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/otp/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "9000000002",
  "code": "123456"
}

### 10. Set Initial Role (Customer)
@meeraToken = {{verifyMeera.response.body.data.accessToken}}
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me/role
Authorization: Bearer {{meeraToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "customer"
}

### 11. Update Customer Profile (Meera)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{meeraToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Meera Joshi",
  "area": "Baner",
  "city": "Pune",
  "location": {
    "lat": 18.5590,
    "lng": 73.7868
  }
}
